vpsAdmin daily report

Period: <%= local_time(@date[:start], '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z') %> - <%= local_time(@date[:end], '%Y-%m-%d %H:%M %Z') %>

Users:
- new: <%= @users[:new][:changed].count %>
- active: <%= @users[:active][:all].count %> total, <%= @users[:active][:changed].count %> changed
- suspended: <%= @users[:suspended][:all].count %> total, <%= @users[:suspended][:changed].count %> changed
- soft deleted: <%= @users[:soft_deleted][:all].count %> total, <%= @users[:soft_deleted][:changed].count %> changed

<% if @user_sessions -%>
User sessions:
Created during period / active now (distinct users in parentheses):
<% created = @user_sessions[:created]; active = @user_sessions[:active] -%>
- Total: <%= created[:total] %> (users: <%= created[:users] %>) / <%= active[:total] %> (users: <%= active[:users] %>)
<% (created[:by_auth_type].keys | active[:by_auth_type].keys).each do |type| -%>
<% added = created[:by_auth_type].fetch(type, { total: 0, users: 0 }); current = active[:by_auth_type].fetch(type, { total: 0, users: 0 }) -%>
- <%= { 'basic' => 'HTTP Basic', 'token' => 'API token', 'oauth2' => 'OAuth2' }.fetch(type, type) %>: <%= added[:total] %> (users: <%= added[:users] %>) / <%= current[:total] %> (users: <%= current[:users] %>)
<% end -%>
Active subsets (already included above; may overlap):
- Permanent credentials: <%= @user_sessions[:permanent][:total] %> (users: <%= @user_sessions[:permanent][:users] %>)
- Administrator-created sessions: <%= @user_sessions[:administrator_created][:total] %> (users: <%= @user_sessions[:administrator_created][:users] %>)
HTTP Basic creates one immediately closed session per authenticated request.
Active sessions have usable credentials, including OAuth2 refresh tokens.
Distinct users may appear under more than one authentication type.

<% end -%>
<% if @password_changes -%>
Password changes during period:
- Total: <%= @password_changes[:total] %>
<% @password_changes[:by_source].each do |source, count| -%>
- <%= { 'recovery' => 'Successful recoveries', 'authenticated' => 'Manual password changes', 'forced_reset' => 'Required password changes', 'administrator' => 'Administrator password changes', 'other' => 'Other password changes' }.fetch(source, source) %>: <%= count %>
<% end -%>

<% end -%>
<% if @password_recoveries -%>
Password recovery activity:
- Processed requests during period: <%= @password_recoveries[:requests] %>
- Recoverable account attempts started during period: <%= @password_recoveries[:started] %>
- Successful recoveries during period: <%= @password_recoveries[:completed] %>
- Unfulfilled attempts during period: <%= @password_recoveries[:unfulfilled] %> (<%= @password_recoveries[:expired] %> expired, <%= @password_recoveries[:invalidated] %> invalidated)
- Unavailable accounts in requests during period: <%= @password_recoveries[:no_mfa] %> without MFA, <%= @password_recoveries[:unavailable] %> otherwise unavailable
- Pending now: <%= @password_recoveries[:pending][:total] %> (<%= @password_recoveries[:pending][:email] %> awaiting the email link, <%= @password_recoveries[:pending][:session] %> in progress)
One request can cover several accounts. Completions and unfulfilled attempts
can come from earlier requests. Successful recoveries are also included in
password changes above; pending attempts are excluded from unfulfilled attempts.
Processed requests do not confirm email delivery.

<% end -%>
<% if @failed_logins -%>
Recorded failed login attempts during period:
- Total: <%= @failed_logins[:total] %> (affected users: <%= @failed_logins[:users] %>)
<% @failed_logins[:by_reason].each do |row| -%>
- <%= row[:auth_type] %> / <%= row[:reason] %>: <%= row[:total] %> (affected users: <%= row[:users] %>)
<% end -%>
These records cover known accounts and include incomplete authentication flows
and recorded password recovery failures. Unknown-account attempts are excluded.

<% end -%>
VPS:
- new: <%= @vps[:new][:changed].count %>
- active: <%= @vps[:active][:all].count %> total, <%= @vps[:active][:changed].count %> changed
- suspended: <%= @vps[:suspended][:all].count %> total, <%= @vps[:suspended][:changed].count %> changed

Storage:
- datasets: <%= @datasets[:all].count %>
- snapshots: <%= @snapshots[:all].count %> total, <%= @snapshots[:new].count %> new
- snapshot downloads: <%= @downloads[:all].count %> total, <%= @downloads[:new].count %> new

Transactions:
- chains: <%= @chains[:total].count %> total, <%= @chains[:all_failed].count %> failed
- transactions: <%= @transactions[:total].count %> total, <%= @transactions[:failed].count %> failed, <%= @transactions[:warning].count %> warning, <%= @transactions[:pending].count %> pending
<% if @payments -%>

Payments:
- incoming: <%= @payments[:incoming].count if @payments[:incoming] %>
- queued: <%= @payments[:queued].count if @payments[:queued] %>
- unmatched: <%= @payments[:unmatched].count if @payments[:unmatched] %>
- accepted: <%= @payments[:accepted].count if @payments[:accepted] %>
<% end -%>
<% if @incident_reports -%>

Incident reports: <%= @incident_reports[:new].count %> new
<% end -%>
